WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.220
"No one would have believed in the last
years of the nineteenth century" what

2
00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.560
was coming.

3
00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:09.260
A man at a desk writes
it all down, years later.

4
00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:11.360
He lived through the invasion.

5
00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:14.910
Two books: 17 chapters, then 10.

6
00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:18.880
Beside him, two paths run
through the same three days.

7
00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:21.170
One is his own, in Surrey.

8
00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:24.470
The other runs through
London, where he never was.

9
00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:28.220
So how does one man describe
scenes he never saw?

10
00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:31.210
In this mission, you'll meet
a narrator who survived,

11
00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:32.610
and is looking back.

12
00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:35.480
And you'll follow the story
as it leaves him behind,

13
00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:38.190
for another person, in another place.

14
00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:42.550
Your mission: work out how he
describes scenes he never saw.
